  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Novgorod CDU-adv prolong - Novg CDU-adviser prolong</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Novgorod CDUr&#xe5;dg f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngn</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;r att f&#xe4;rdigst&#xe4;lla de p&#xe5;b&#xf6;rjade Corporate Develpment Plans f&#xf6;r VA- fj&#xe4;rrv&#xe4;rme och avfallsbolagen i Novgorod stad, finansierar Sida en f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngning av CDU Suport Team under 12 m&#xe5;n. Ytterligare  institutionella activiteter inom insatsen &#xe4;r: socio-economic study, omorganisation, samt informationskampanj.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to complete the CDP for water and wastewater-, heating- and SWM-companies in Novgorod, Sida intends to finance a prolongation of the CDU Support Team an additional 12 months. The project also includes: socio-economic study, reorganisation, and a public awareness campaign.</narrative>
  </description>
